---
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/auth.css';
---
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#141b16" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <title>Crear cuenta | Flight Hunter</title>
  <script defer src="https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web"></script>
</head>
<body class="auth-page" data-auth-mode="register">
  <div class="auth-layout">
    <section class="auth-visual" aria-label="Descubrí Flight Hunter">
      <div class="auth-visual-inner">
        <a class="auth-brand" href="/"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36" /> Flight Hunter</a>
        <div class="auth-story">
          <span class="auth-kicker">Tu próximo viaje, a la vista</span>
          <h1>Más ganas de viajar.<br /><em>Menos búsquedas.</em></h1>
          <p>Elegí destinos, fechas y el precio que pagarías. Tu radar reúne las opciones que encuentra para que puedas decidir con calma.</p>
          <div class="auth-route"><span>TUS FECHAS</span><i class="ph ph-airplane-tilt" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>TUS POSIBILIDADES</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <main class="auth-panel">
      <div class="auth-content">
        <a class="auth-back" href="/"><i class="ph ph-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Volver al inicio</a>
        <div class="auth-heading"><span class="auth-kicker">El primer paso</span><h2 id="auth-title">Un viaje por delante.</h2><p id="auth-description">Creá tu cuenta. Después elegimos dónde y cuándo querés viajar.</p></div>
        <form id="auth-form" class="auth-form">
          <div class="auth-field"><label for="auth-name">Nombre completo</label><input id="auth-name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Tu nombre" autocomplete="name" required /></div>
          <div class="auth-field"><label for="auth-email">Email</label><input id="auth-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="tu@email.com" autocomplete="email" required /></div>
          <div class="auth-field"><label for="auth-password">Contraseña</label><input id="auth-password" name="password" type="password" placeholder="Al menos 6 caracteres" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="6" required /></div>
          <div class="auth-field"><label for="auth-confirm">Confirmar contraseña</label><input id="auth-confirm" name="password_confirm" type="password" placeholder="Repetí tu contraseña" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="6" required /></div><label class="auth-consent"><input type="checkbox" required /> <span>Acepto los Términos y Condiciones y la Política de Privacidad</span></label>
          <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="auth-action">Crear mi cuenta <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
          <div class="auth-divider">o</div><button type="button" class="auth-google" id="google-btn"><i class="ph ph-google-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i> Continuar con Google</button>
        </form>
        <p id="error-msg" class="auth-message" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <section id="confirmation" class="auth-confirmation" aria-labelledby="confirmation-title" hidden>
          <div class="auth-confirmation-icon"><i class="ph ph-envelope-simple-open" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
          <h3 id="confirmation-title" tabindex="-1">Revisá tu correo</h3>
          <p>Enviamos un enlace a <strong id="confirmation-email"></strong>. Abrilo para confirmar tu cuenta y empezar tu primer radar.</p>
          <p>Si no lo encontrás, revisá Spam o Correo no deseado.</p>
          <a href="/login" class="auth-action">Ya confirmé, iniciar sesión <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
          <button id="resend-btn" class="auth-google" type="button">Reenviar el correo</button>
          <p id="resend-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <button id="change-email" class="auth-text-button" type="button">Usar otro email</button>
        </section>
        <p class="auth-switch">¿Ya tenés cuenta? <a href="/login">Iniciar sesión</a></p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script>
    import { mountAuth } from '../utils/authFlow';
    mountAuth();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
